# S0p hold twin of pf_cache_large.prog (OD-L3-119 item 2): the same input under the hold W schedule,
# header bit 1 only.
start hold
# S0p: one input's whole block budget in fan-out blocks, so that the node's coins cache passes
# its LARGE line (or THRESHOLD) and the flush is mirrored to Core; then a KILL.
# It starts in IBD and leaves it at its second block, whose LEFT_IBD freeze the fan-out blocks
# build on: a restore at T_RECENT arms no LEFT_IBD (BL-969).
start old
extend main 1
warp 30
extend main 8 tx=fan
extend main 8 tx=fan
extend main 8 tx=fan
extend main 8 tx=fan
extend main 8 tx=fan
extend main 8 tx=fan
extend main 8 tx=fan
extend main 8 tx=fan
restart kill
